  "title": "Creator Thumbnails",
  "desc": "Unpaid spec work for creators on MyLegacy Management’s roster, researched from their public channels. K.Overlegen makes Minecraft Epic Fight mod showcases, so his kit follows his own “This Mod Adds” titles and his tagline. Chris2003 makes FNAF and Sonic videos, so his pieces live inside a night shift camera feed. Mighty is a high-energy gaming creator known for competitive play and live commentary, so his banner and profile picture are built for a loud, fast stream. The Snackd post is built on the shop’s own lines, “Unbox the unexpected!” and “Snacks of the World”. Every scene is drawn from scratch with no game footage or franchise characters. Not commissioned.",
